符串"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["", "Perform retouching on the image to ensure the bottle's surface is smooth, free of any scratches or stains, with lighting adjusted to a professional studio light for sharp, defined shadows. Use a white backdrop, achieving a product-rendering level of overall texture. The text composition must remain clearly visible, and the bottle must retain the exact same position and proportions."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 2216, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [283.6921691894531, 202.84597778320312], "pos": [-1515.0810546875, 2441.302734375], "id": 452, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 1813, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [424.4890441894531, 624.508056640625], "pos": [-1668.8812255859375, 966.9566650390625], "id": 444, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "SaveImage", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["\n## Flux Kontext 提示词技巧\n\n使用英文\n\n### 1.基础修改\n- 简单直接：'“将汽车颜色更改为红色”'\n- 保持风格：'“改为白天，同时保持画作的风格相同”'\n\n### 2.风格转换\n**原则：**\n- 明确命名风格：'“转变为包豪斯艺术风格”\n- 描述特征：'“转换为油画，笔触可见，颜料纹理厚重”'\n- 保留构图：'“在保持原始构图的同时更改为包豪斯风格”'\n\n### 3.角色一致性\n**框架：**\n- 具体描述：'“黑短发的女人”'而非'“她”'\n- 保留特征：'“同时保持相同的面部特征、发型和表情”'\n- 分步修改：先改背景，再改动作\n\n### 4.文本编辑\n- 使用引号：'“将 'joy' 替换为 'BFL'”'\n- 保持格式：'“在保持相同字体样式的同时替换文本”'\n\n## 常见问题解决\n\n### 角色变化过大\n❌ 错误：'“把人变成维京人”'\n✅ 正确：'“换衣服成为维京战士，同时保留面部特征”'\n\n### 构图位置改变\n❌ 错误：'“把他放在海滩上”'\n✅ 正确：'“将背景更改为海滩，同时保持人物处于完全相同的位置、比例和姿势”'\n\n### 风格应用不准确\n❌ 错误：'“使其成为草图”'\n✅ 正确：'“转换为具有自然石墨线条、交叉影线和可见纸张纹理的铅笔素描”'\n\n## 核心原则\n\n1. **具体明确** - 使用精确描述，避免模糊词汇\n2. **分步编辑** - 复杂修改分为多个简单步骤\n3. **明确保留** - 说明哪些要保持不变\n4. **动词选择** - 用\"更改\"、\"替换\"而非\"转换\"\n\n## 最佳实践模板\n\n**对象修改：**\n'“将 [对象] 更改为 [新状态]，保持 [要保留的内容] 不变”'\n\n**风格转换：**\n'“转换为 [特定风格]，同时保持 [构图/角色/其他] 不变”'\n\n**背景替换：**\n'“将背景更改为 [新背景]，保持主体处于完全相同的位置和姿势”'\n\n**文本编辑：**\n'“将'[原始文本]'替换为'[新文本]'，保持相同的字体样式”'\n\n> **记住：** 越具体越好，Kontext 擅长理解详细指令并保持一致性。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "TextInput_", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [412.7401428222656, 983.856689453125], "pos": [-2782.693603515625, 1333.2275390625], "id": 426, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "TextInput_", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [2227], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["让图片做精修处理，369光滑的表面，没有任何的划痕和污渍，光影变成摄影棚专业光，十分锐利的光影，白色的画布，整体质感达到产品渲染级别，文字构图必须保持清晰可见，保持369处于完全相同的位置、比例."], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "TextInput_", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-2289.54736328125, 2090.8642578125], "id": 439, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "TextInput_", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [2313], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["瓶子"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "TextInput_", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [210, 161.22805786132812], "pos": [-2340.431884765625, 1413.3355712890625], "id": 453, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TextInput_", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["1.主要用于一键产品精修，工作流可以自测，可以精修白底图，最好是拍摄好的白底图.\n\n2.尺寸不建议调太大的值，以免脱离kontext训练大小.\n\n3.使用教程，主要是在下列文本输入产品名称，描述产品外观，不用很详细.（例如瓶子，水瓶）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 174.12554931640625], "pos": [-2344.3154296875, 1177.141357421875], "id": 447, "properties": {}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [1758], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [1536, 1536, 4], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "EmptyLatentImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [210, 106], "pos": [-2342.115234375, 988.499755859375], "id": 386, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.42", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyLatentImage", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#533", "groupcolor": "#A88", "color": "#322"}}, "order": 11}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [4980, 4981, 4982, 4983, 4984], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [{"controller": 406, "upstream": "390", "downstream_slot": 1, "downstream": 394, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "VAE"}, {"controller": 406, "upstream": "390", "downstream_slot": 1, "downstream": 180, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "VAE"}, {"controller": 406, "upstream": "454", "downstream_slot": 0, "downstream": 181, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "MODEL"}, {"controller": 407, "upstream": "386", "downstream_slot": 3, "downstream": 181, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "LATENT"}, {"controller": 406, "upstream": "388", "downstream_slot": 0, "downstream": 184, "upstream_slot": 0, "type": "CLIP"}], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.23.4", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "groupNodes": {}, "node_versions": {"comfy-core": "0.3.42", "ComfyUI_essentials": "33ff89fd354d8ec3ab6affb605a79a931b445d99"}, "ds": {"offset": [2876.7048051382894, -818.0040764857645], "scale": 1.7088742511245874}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "F.1kontext 模型+cilp", "bounding": [-1184.6